{"data": [{"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:27:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120614475317567991"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/co6EOn04bA", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2120614475317567991/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120614458267705345", "start": 141, "url": "https://t.co/co6EOn04bA"}]}, "id": "2120614475317567991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 13442, "like_count": 143, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Lifting weights 3x a week while taking a GLP-1 preserved muscle, had double digit strength gains, and got rid of fat.\n\nLifting + GLP-1s FTW. https://t.co/co6EOn04bA", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2120614475317567991"}, {"author_id": "166252256", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:21:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120612788016161102"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "166252256", "start": 19, "username": "ENERGY"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/FZ21zVJek2", "end": 169, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2120612788016161102/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120612561062174721", "start": 146, "url": "https://t.co/FZ21zVJek2"}]}, "id": "2120612788016161102", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2303, "like_count": 44, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "This Veterans Day, @ENERGY leadership honors the American heroes whose courage and sacrifice have defended our nation and protected our freedoms. https://t.co/FZ21zVJek2", "url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2120612788016161102"}, {"author_id": "16933019", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:17:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120611962568749295"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/JesseJenkins/s…", "end": 135, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/JesseJenkins/status/2120301005447331956", "start": 112, "url": "https://t.co/iUljrMAiwx"}]}, "id": "2120611962568749295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 832, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120301005447331956", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Two things are true: EVs are still a tiny source of oil demand and they will quickly replace 40% of oil demand. https://t.co/iUljrMAiwx", "url": "https://x.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2120611962568749295"}, {"author_id": "61559439", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:53:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120605813047718264"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Q0CIXu9jvy", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2120605813047718264/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120605669564780544", "start": 156, "url": "https://t.co/Q0CIXu9jvy"}]}, "id": "2120605813047718264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 16045, "like_count": 164, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "This Veterans Day, we honor all who have served, including veterans across our NVIDIA community.\n\nThank you for your service.\n\n📍 NVIDIA HQ, Santa Clara, CA https://t.co/Q0CIXu9jvy", "url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2120605813047718264"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:01:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120592748608893198"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/eCwz4T6kvG", "end": 284, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2120592748608893198/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120592733492670464", "start": 261, "url": "https://t.co/eCwz4T6kvG"}]}, "id": "2120592748608893198", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 184, "impression_count": 45682, "like_count": 660, "quote_count": 16, "reply_count": 78, "retweet_count": 55}, "text": "LSD as a longevity therapy? \n\nLSD pushes brain gene activity in the opposite direction of aging\n\nIn rodents, the effect was stronger than exercise\n\nLSD activated gene networks involved in neuroplasticity and neuronal communication, and reduced amyloid-β damage https://t.co/eCwz4T6kvG", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2120592748608893198"}, {"author_id": "4939401", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:34:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120571001843130707"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/stripe/status/…", "end": 40, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/stripe/status/2120550087256682585", "start": 17, "url": "https://t.co/XNrZPSP2mM"}]}, "id": "2120571001843130707", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 23484, "like_count": 215, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120550087256682585", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Welcome Parafin! https://t.co/XNrZPSP2mM", "url": "https://x.com/patrickc/status/2120571001843130707"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:11:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120565062683238753"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Renewables 2026 - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/4iplKDY", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/4iplKDY", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118569536668467200/IhJK8s54?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118569536668467200/IhJK8s54?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 250, "status": 200, "title": "Renewables 2026 - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/renewables-2026?utm_content=buffere0d41&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/TMCZR1yeIJ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/d2D0m8q4HI", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120565062683238753/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120565060267331584", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/d2D0m8q4HI"}]}, "id": "2120565062683238753", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1985, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Ensuring secure &amp; diversified renewables supply chains is vital as their role in energy systems grow.\n\nChina continues to lead solar module manufacturing – a market that is highly concentrated today.\n\nBut India is emerging as a key alternative 👉 https://t.co/TMCZR1yeIJ https://t.co/d2D0m8q4HI", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120565062683238753"}, {"author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120562196472070641"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Rl7VnZZTp2", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2120562196472070641/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120468715175088128", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/Rl7VnZZTp2"}]}, "id": "2120562196472070641", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3178, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Nuclear energy, science and technology can help countries produce clean energy, strengthen food and energy security and protect the environment. \n\nThe IAEA will showcase these solutions at the 31st United Nations Climate Change Conference – COP31 – in Antalya, Türkiye, from 9 to https://t.co/Rl7VnZZTp2", "url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2120562196472070641"}, {"author_id": "1455964430760431622", "created_at": "2026-11-11T16:48:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120559354437157124"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 101, "id": "347931190", "start": 87, "username": "GladstoneInst"}, {"end": 113, "id": "1287473195482636288", "start": 104, "username": "andcyang"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7avz1XIf3S", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/arcinstitute/status/2120559354437157124/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120558028659544064", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/7avz1XIf3S"}]}, "id": "2120559354437157124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 4497, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "The blood-brain barrier (BBB) is typically defined by what it keeps out. New work from @gladstoneinst’s @andcyang, an Arc Innovation Investigator, and team maps what it imports, finding a “transportome” of 92 plasma proteins that the BBB routes to particular brain cell types. https://t.co/7avz1XIf3S", "url": "https://x.com/arcinstitute/status/2120559354437157124"}, {"author_id": "3169963433", "created_at": "2026-11-11T16:02:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120547742611038702"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/BvQ2RvSNCe", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OurWorldInData/status/2120547742611038702/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120547739813429248", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/BvQ2RvSNCe"}]}, "id": "2120547742611038702", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 5102, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "What does poverty look like beyond income?\n\nSomeone can live above an income poverty line and still go without electricity, clean drinking water, or schooling.\n\nThe global Multidimensional Poverty Index (MPI), from the Oxford Poverty and Human Development Initiative and the UN https://t.co/BvQ2RvSNCe", "url": "https://x.com/OurWorldInData/status/2120547742611038702"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:31:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120539900101464476"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Global Critical Minerals Outlook 2026 - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/4w9Bn5Z", "end": 283, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/4w9Bn5Z", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539948545609728/A2SXrvJn?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539948545609728/A2SXrvJn?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 260, "status": 200, "title": "Executive summary - Global Critical Minerals Outlook 2026 - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/global-critical-minerals-outlook-2026/executive-summary?utm_content=buffer5af48&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/zshwfrovJf"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/22MFW9LZdZ", "end": 307, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120539900101464476/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120539897970790400", "start": 284, "url": "https://t.co/22MFW9LZdZ"}]}, "id": "2120539900101464476", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2443, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "Relatively small amounts of critical minerals underpin trillions of dollars in economic value globally\n\nThe rare earth export controls introduced in 2025 highlighted the vulnerabilities of concentrated supply chains – &amp; the importance of diversification 👉 https://t.co/zshwfrovJf https://t.co/22MFW9LZdZ", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120539900101464476"}, {"author_id": "166252256", "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:12:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120535122466251165"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/l3wm8nt6A5", "end": 192, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2120535122466251165/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120535114094383105", "start": 169, "url": "https://t.co/l3wm8nt6A5"}]}, "id": "2120535122466251165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 6403, "like_count": 361, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 43, "retweet_count": 85}, "text": "Happy Veterans Day from the Energy Department. 🇺🇸 \n\nToday, we honor the brave men and women who have served our great nation and sacrificed to defend America’s freedom. https://t.co/l3wm8nt6A5", "url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2120535122466251165"}, {"author_id": "16933019", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:32:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120525071252951434"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Ric_RTP/status…", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Ric_RTP/status/2120185766148010139", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/XAKM9SUKIk"}]}, "id": "2120525071252951434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2455, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120185766148010139", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "After the Anthropic IPO the control stays with the current founders and board, even if the founders give away to charity. This will keep the mission central and make ik harder to simply sell the company to the highest bidder.\n\nRicardo seems outraged.\nI think it's great. https://t.co/XAKM9SUKIk", "url": "https://x.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2120525071252951434"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:15:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120520778831585515"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Heat Pump Monitor 2026 - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/3TUE7Hr", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/3TUE7Hr", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120520828852789248/yY7-gUEF?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120520828852789248/yY7-gUEF?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 259, "status": 200, "title": "Heat Pump Monitor 2026 - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/heat-pump-monitor-2026?utm_content=bufferd3557&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/SAJoPeH3M0"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/gsle8UwSgR", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120520778831585515/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120520776587657216", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/gsle8UwSgR"}]}, "id": "2120520778831585515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2283, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Heat pumps can play an important role in delivering secure, affordable &amp; sustainable heating around the world\n\nOur Heat Pump Monitor includes 20 interactive dashboards allowing users to explore the latest market trends, regional insights &amp; policies 👉 https://t.co/SAJoPeH3M0 https://t.co/gsle8UwSgR", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120520778831585515"}, {"author_id": "325581008", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:01:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120502216062558674"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LvD98RQwGs", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NRCgov/status/2120502216062558674/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120502209754349568", "start": 0, "url": "https://t.co/LvD98RQwGs"}]}, "id": "2120502216062558674", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 609, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/LvD98RQwGs", "url": "https://x.com/NRCgov/status/2120502216062558674"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:15:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120475414065770933"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 155, "start": 149, "tag": "COP31"}], "urls": [{"description": "Synergies between waste reduction, resource efficiency and energy systems decarbonisation - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/3VgOWnS", "end": 287, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/3VgOWnS", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120475420269158402/ke1ujf4U?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120475420269158402/ke1ujf4U?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 264, "status": 200, "title": "Synergies between waste reduction, resource efficiency and energy systems decarbonisation - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/synergies-between-waste-reduction-resource-efficiency-and-energy-systems-decarbonisation?utm_content=buffer9e