ptured and stored by coastal ecosystems, covering ~50 million hectares globally.\n\nSwipe to see how blue carbon and nuclear science are protecting our oceans.\n\n#Atoms4Climate https://t.co/2yM1Jsa0i0", "url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2120443769703301283"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-11T09:02:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120442115289158025"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 17, "start": 11, "tag": "COP31"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "iea.li/40K0xw8", "end": 221, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/40K0xw8", "start": 198, "status": 403, "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/events/iea-at-cop29?utm_content=bufferb216d&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/IXKbmx2wHt"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/JtRFv80lu0", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120442115289158025/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120442112629997569", "start": 222, "url": "https://t.co/JtRFv80lu0"}]}, "id": "2120442115289158025", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2437, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Are you at #COP31? Join IEA experts for today’s events:\n\n▶️ Renewables Market Outlook\n▶️ Power Sector Resilience in the Baltic &amp; Nordic regions\n▶️ Towards Zero Waste\n▶️ AI &amp; Energy\n\nMore ➡️ https://t.co/IXKbmx2wHt https://t.co/JtRFv80lu0", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2120442115289158025"}, {"author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-11-11T09:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120441414022836558", "2120443769703301283"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Nk6cnJlOSx", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2120441414022836558/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120435974865858560", "start": 254, "url": "https://t.co/Nk6cnJlOSx"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Nk6cnJlOSx", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2120441414022836558/photo/1", "media_key": "3_212043599808978124